WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.850
- [Narrator] Meet Bangalore's
most colorful resident.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.820
In a world where some people
dress to get through the day,

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.216
this man dresses to stand out.

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:10.716
(light music)

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:16.637
(engine rumbling)
(horns honking)

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.690
- [Narrator] Seven was
raised in a spiritual family

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.480
that wore all-white.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.250
- [Narrator] So what
started with one red tie

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.583
has led to a life's mission.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:47.870
- [Narrator] But wait,
back to the number seven.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.067
- [Narrator] And now,
how 'bout a home tour?

00:01:06.242 --> 00:01:08.750
(light music)

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.020
- [Narrator] Even Seven's family

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.770
has gotten into the color scheme.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.780
- [Narrator] There have
been mixed reactions

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:54.390
to Seven's lifestyle.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:58.223
But for him, living a
unique life is worth it.

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:12.134
(upbeat music)

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:16.166
(gentle music)

